# 2026-09-07 (security review): defence in depth. The DocumentRoot is meant to be public/ (see
# INSTALL.md), so this repo root should never be web-served. If an operator points the docroot here
# by mistake, deny everything rather than expose coldvault.env, schema/, tools/ or .git/.
Require all denied
<IfModule !mod_authz_core.c>
  Order deny,allow
  Deny from all
</IfModule>
